78
00:05:13,313 --> 00:05:16,983
Correcto. Muéstrale a nuestro
nuevo amigo qué bien deletreas.

79
00:05:17,734 --> 00:05:19,444
Deletrea "bungaló".

80
00:05:20,278 --> 00:05:24,741
B-u-n-g-a-l-o.

81
00:05:25,366 --> 00:05:27,535
