95
00:06:11,162 --> 00:06:14,040
Te aseguro que no cerrarías
esas piernas aunque quisieras.

96
00:06:15,625 --> 00:06:16,918
Me recuerda a su madre.

97
00:06:28,429 --> 00:06:29,522
Yo...

98
00:06:29,722 --> 00:06:31,516
Creí que se dirigían a Portland.

99
00:06:32,225 --> 00:06:33,643
